  "recordSet": [],
  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "real_robot_data",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tReal Robot Manipulation Dataset\n\t\n\nTabletop manipulation tasks recorded on a UR5e with a Robotiq 2F-140\ngripper. Most tasks use two Intel RealSense cameras (fixed base + wrist-mounted);\nthe newest hide_block_with_cup task adds a third (opposite-side counter view).\nAll recordings at 20 Hz.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tTasks\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\nFolder\nEps\nCameras\nInstruction\n\n\n\t\t\nput_blocks_in_plate\n100\n2\nPick two blocks from the table and place them on the plate.\n\n\nremove_blocks_from_plate\n100\n2\nPick two\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/Hoshipu/real_robot_data.",
  "alternateName": [
    "Hoshipu/real_robot_data"
  ],
  "creator": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Zhiyuan Li",
    "url": "https://huggingface.co/Hoshipu"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "robotics",
    "apache-2.0",
    "100K<n<1M",
    "\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 Region: US",
    "real-robot",
    "manipulation",
    "ur5e",
    "imitation-learning"
  ],
  "license": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/apache-2.0/",
  "url": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/Hoshipu/real_robot_data",
